
// Dark Skies DLC

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BSBE_ProprietarySpaceResearch=Proprietary Space Research
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BSBE_ProprietarySpaceResearch=We find near-term solutions for our space resource demands. 

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BSBE_ResponsibleNuclearWeaponSystems=Responsible Nuclear Weapon Systems
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BSBE_ResponsibleNuclearWeaponSystems=We devise a way to once again build nuclear weapons.  
TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BSBE_ResponsibleNuclearWeaponSystems=Nuclear weapons are, for obvious reasons, widely reviled. So much so that even if we knew how to make them, we wouldn't be allowed to. Solving the theoretical and engineering problems proved to be remarkably straightforward. Solving the political and social issues was not. However, through a mixture of bribery, blackmail, misrepresentations, whataboutisms, misleading graphs, falsified data, accusing our enemies of building them, denying our own involvement, sunk cost fallacies, calling the opposition traitors, arresting protesters, distracting scandals, memes, and miscellaneous dishonesty that doesn't fit cleanly into a specific category - we made it work. 

